{"lines": ["In September nineteen seventy-nine, an American spy satellite saw two flashes over an empty ocean.", "A blink, then a longer glow.", "That double flash is the signature of a nuclear bomb.", "The satellite had seen it forty-one times before.", "Every one was a confirmed nuclear test.", "This one came from near the Prince Edward Islands, far south of Africa.", "No ship reported it. No country claimed it.", "Air Force planes flew twenty-five sampling flights.", "They found no fallout.", "A White House panel said probably not a bomb, maybe space dust.", "But in Australia, sheep were reported to carry traces of radioactive iodine.", "Navy scientists said underwater microphones heard a matching blast.", "President Carter wrote in his diary that his scientists believed Israel did it.", "Neither country has ever admitted it.", "So who lit up the ocean that night?", "Nobody explained it."], "words": [["In", 0.0, 0.1], ["September", 0.1, 0.42], ["nineteen", 0.42, 0.799], ["seventy-nine,", 0.799, 1.32], ["an", 2.06, 2.24], ["American", 2.24, 2.56], ["spy", 2.56, 2.96], ["satellite", 2.96, 3.4], ["saw", 3.4, 3.74], ["two", 3.74, 4.0], ["flashes", 4.0, 4.34], ["over", 4.34, 4.86], ["an", 4.86, 4.98], ["empty", 4.98, 5.24], ["ocean.", 5.24, 5.54], ["A", 6.119, 6.2], ["blink,", 6.2, 6.42], ["then", 6.86, 7.1], ["a", 7.1, 7.22], ["longer", 7.22, 7.52], ["glow.", 7.52, 7.84], ["That", 8.342, 8.48], ["double", 8.48, 8.72], ["flash", 8.72, 9.2], ["is", 9.2, 9.48], ["the", 9.48, 9.62], ["signature", 9.62, 9.98], ["of", 9.98, 10.3], ["a", 10.3, 10.36], ["nuclear", 10.36, 10.56], ["bomb.", 10.56, 11.0], ["The", 11.555, 11.64], ["satellite", 11.64, 11.92], ["had", 11.92, 12.26], ["seen", 12.26, 12.48], ["it", 12.48, 12.62], ["forty-one", 12.62, 12.86], ["times", 12.86, 13.38], ["before.", 13.38, 13.8], ["Every", 14.323, 14.462], ["one", 14.462, 14.56], ["was", 14.56, 14.98], ["a", 14.98, 15.1], ["confirmed", 15.1, 15.28], ["nuclear", 15.28, 15.84], ["test.", 15.84, 16.38], ["T